  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Talent Acceleration Program (TAP) Nexus Skills and Jobs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Talent Acceleration Platform (TAP) Nexus Skills and Jobs project focuses on reducing the high unemployment rate among university graduates and young professionals in Palestine by enhancing their employability in the local and international job markets. The project aims to bridge the gap between the educational foundations provided by universities and the specific skills required by employers. TAP&apos;s intervention strategy is multifaceted, incorporating upskilling, market alignment, financial sustainability, and a strong emphasis on gender equality. The project offers tailored up-skilling opportunities that align closely with market needs, ensuring graduates are equipped with both the technical and soft skills required for the digital and tech industries. This approach includes hands-on training, English language enhancement, and the cultivation of 21st-century skills such as critical thinking and teamwork.The project aims to train over 400 learners over two years and place 80% in high-quality remote international jobs through fostering partnerships with international employers in MENA and the EU.</narrative>
  </description>
